# Build-time API URL override.
# When the web app is bundled (vite build), this URL is embedded into the JS.
# For local browser dev (npm run dev), leave this empty — Vite proxies /api to the backend.
#
# Examples:
#   VITE_API_URL=                                # empty → same-origin (browser dev)
#   VITE_API_URL=https://skillswap-api.onrender.com
#   VITE_API_URL=http://10.0.2.2:4000            # Android emulator → host loopback
#
# For an already-built APK, you can also edit
#   android/app/src/main/assets/public/config.json
# and re-sync (`npx cap sync android`) without rebuilding TypeScript.
VITE_API_URL=